              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw abantu bawe, ari bo nzu ya Yakobo, wabahebeshejwe n’uko buzuyemw’ imigenzo ivuye i burasirazuba, bakaragura nk’Abafilisitiya, kandi bakifatanya n’abana b’abanyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu cabo na co cuzuye ifeza n’izahabu, kand’ ubutunzi bgabo n’isinzi; igihugu cabo cuzuye n’amafarasi, imikogote yabo n’ibitayega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.2.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 2:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu cabo cuzuye n’ibigirwamana; basenga ivyakozwe n’amaboko yabo, intoke zabo ubgabo ari zo zabikoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bazosubizwa hasi, abahambaye bacishwe bugufi; nawe ntuz’ ubaharire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Injira mw isenga, wihishe mu mukungugu, uhunge ubukare bg’Uhoraho, n’ubgiza bg’icubahiro ciwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurābana agakēngērwe kw’abantu kuzocishwa bugufi, n’ubgibone bg’abahambaye buzosubizwa hasi, Uhoraho wenyene ni we azoba ashizwe hejuru kur’ uwo musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.40.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 40:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.40.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo afitiye umusi ivyibona vyose n’ivyivuna, n’ivyishira hejuru vyose, kandi bizocishwa bugufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.11.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi uzoba no ku biti vy’amasederi vy’i Lebanoni vyose birebire vyishira hejuru, no ku vy’imyeloni vy’i Bashani vyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku misozi miremire yose, no ku misozi yose yishira hejuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku munara wose ushizwe hejuru, no ku ruzitiro rurerure rwose rw’amabuye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku māto yose y’i Tarushishi, no ku bishushanyo vyose binezereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ agakēngērwe k’abantu kazosubizwa hasi, n’ubgibone bg’abahambaye buzocishwa bugufi, Uhoraho wenyene ni we azoba ashizwe hejuru kur’ uwo musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibigirwamana bizoherengetera rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
